{
  "_description": "VG-TASK-SCOPE cases (18.174): each case is a domain binding and the enforcement-point ToolCalls of one subject; verification/gates/task_scope.sh builds the bundle, the real Python, TypeScript and Java CLIs assess it against the baseline catalog and the Conduct overlay, and CND-01's outcome and failing calls must be the expected ones in every engine. A call's agentcetask is the CloudEvents task attribute, refs_task its refs.task, deny adds an enforcement-point PolicyDecision denying it (\"after\" or \"before\" the call, or \"unheld\": naming an event no record holds), and subject \"other\" records the call under a second subject, whose CND-01 reading is expected_other. A domain of \"@template\" is skills/agentce-get-evidence/assets/task-scope.template.yaml with <task-type> = credit-review and <tool-name> = lookup.",
